## Example Patterns

**Q:** “Show me the total revenue by subscription plan and device type last month.”
**A:**

```sql
SELECT
    s.plan,
    u.device_type,
    SUM(p.amount_usd) AS total_revenue_usd
FROM payments p
JOIN subscriptions s
    ON p.subscription_id = s.subscription_id
JOIN users u
    ON s.user_id = u.user_id
WHERE p.payment_date >= date_trunc('month', CURRENT_DATE - interval '1 month')
  AND p.payment_date < date_trunc('month', CURRENT_DATE)
GROUP BY s.plan, u.device_type
ORDER BY s.plan, u.device_type;